        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Rumford Baldwin, Loammi Baldwin Jr.\n- Organizations: Boston Society of Civil Engineers, Boston and Maine Railroad\n- Projects: Boston and Lowell Railroad\n- Places: Massachusetts\n\nFacts:\n- Loammi Baldwin Jr. was the brother of George Rumford Baldwin.\n- Loammi Baldwin Jr. helped design the Boston and Lowell Railroad in Massachusetts.\n- The Boston and Lowell Railroad was a historic railroad.\n- The Boston and Lowell Railroad line later operated as part of the Boston and Maine Railroad.\n- George Rumford Baldwin was president of the Boston Society of Civil Engineers.",
